WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:19.500
Most staffing firms send a candidate with a resume. This platform sends a scored readiness profile and a governance trail proving it.

2
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:33.500
Each sector suite maps to a real external certification. This one ties directly to HFMA's own CRCR credential.

3
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:47.500
Checking off real evidence moves the readiness score live, with an explainability record behind every point.

4
00:00:47.500 --> 00:01:03.500
Nothing deploys on a passing score alone. A named manager approves the evidence, on the record.

5
00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:17.500
That approval just unlocked the Earning Path live, in the same session — governance gating the payout.

6
00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:33.500
One approved record feeds every package — resume, interview, staffing submission — a firm hands its client.

